  "name": null,
  "problem": "By changing the order of integration in the following repeated integrals so that they are integrated first with respect to $z,$ then $x,$ and then $y,$ express the following sum as a single repeated integral.\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{-1}^{0}{\\int }_{-2{x}^{3}}^{2}{\\int }_{-y}^{x+3}f(x,y,z)\\,\\text{d}z\\,\\text{d}y\\,\\text{d}x+{\\int }_{0}^{2}{\\int }_{\\sqrt{2x}}^{2}{\\int }_{-y}^{x+3}f(x,y,z)\\,\\text{d}z\\,\\text{d}y\\,\\text{d}x\n$$",
